<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xml:lang="bn-Beng-IN" id="m81289-fs-id2140985.bn-Beng-IN"><title>m81289-fs-id2140985</title><content><section id="fs-id2140985" class="section-exercises">
<section id="fs-id1392232" class="practice-perfect"><title>অনুশীলনে দক্ষতা বাড়ে</title><para id="fs-id1264711"><emphasis effect="bold">লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর নির্ণয়</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-638">নীচের অনুশীলনীগুলিতে প্রতিটি ভগ্নাংশগুচ্ছের লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর নির্ণয় করো। প্রদত্ত হরগুলির ল.সা.গু. ব্যবহার করো।</para><exercise id="fs-id1693271">
<problem id="fs-id2165554">
<para id="fs-id1612201"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1336524">
<problem id="fs-id2443844">
<para id="fs-id1410437"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1330160">
<para id="fs-id2620045">20</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1381545">
<problem id="fs-id1518942">
<para id="fs-id2789410"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1613697">
<problem id="fs-id1166761303488">
<para id="fs-id1509394"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2278392">
<para id="fs-id2880438">48</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1282534">
<problem id="fs-id2939653">
<para id="fs-id2399108"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1822983">
<problem id="fs-id2265456">
<para id="fs-id1225002"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>48</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2670099">
<para id="fs-id3292935">240</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id4338002">
<problem id="fs-id1346528">
<para id="fs-id2296178"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>39</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>56</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1546363">
<problem id="fs-id1266693">
<para id="fs-id3327243"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>33</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>49</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2150140">
<para id="fs-id3165471">245</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2453013">
<problem id="fs-id1341463">
<para id="fs-id1166761237483"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2880413">
<problem id="fs-id4127957">
<para id="fs-id2277404"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165958">
<para id="fs-id1312557">60</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1726052"><emphasis effect="bold">লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হরযুক্ত সমতুল ভগ্নাংশে রূপান্তর</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-423">নীচের অনুশীলনীগুলিতে প্রদত্ত লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর ব্যবহার করে ভগ্নাংশগুলিকে সমতুল ভগ্নাংশে রূপান্তর করো।</para><exercise id="fs-id2840494">
<problem id="fs-id1575684">
<para id="fs-id2334041"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2267080">
<problem id="fs-id2269379">
<para id="fs-id942496"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2303878">
<para id="fs-id1909873"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1950937">
<problem id="fs-id2149494">
<para id="fs-id1562493"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2224474">
<problem id="fs-id1858526">
<para id="fs-id2666150"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1605432">
<para id="fs-id2819323"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1371986">
<problem id="fs-id2134081">
<para id="fs-id2715571"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>48</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2454125">
<problem id="fs-id1245510">
<para id="fs-id2924694"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>48</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1614232">
<para id="fs-id2629699"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>33</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>48</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>48</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1458722">
<problem id="fs-id2707468">
<para id="fs-id1465158"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1499436">
<problem id="fs-id2471534">
<para id="fs-id2139816"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>60</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1835207">
<para id="fs-id1788989"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>60</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>45</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>60</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>36</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>60</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1309307"><emphasis effect="bold">ভিন্ন হরযুক্ত ভগ্নাংশের যোগ ও বিয়োগ</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-429">নীচের অনুশীলনীগুলিতে যোগ বা বিয়োগ করো। ফলটি লঘিষ্ঠ আকারে লেখো।</para><exercise id="fs-id1752471">
<problem id="fs-id1562014">
<para id="fs-id1560076"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2308556">
<problem id="fs-id1764836">
<para id="fs-id871832"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1559966">
<para id="fs-id2198454"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1750268">
<problem id="fs-id1798687">
<para id="fs-id1968540"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1859655">
<problem id="fs-id2310581">
<para id="fs-id1950381"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2662763">
<para id="fs-id1791921"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1311590">
<problem id="fs-id2751084">
<para id="fs-id2648982"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1356855">
<problem id="fs-id1338286">
<para id="fs-id2279785"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2198534">
<para id="fs-id2813321"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1805296">
<problem id="fs-id2197014">
<para id="fs-id2281472"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2277350">
<problem id="fs-id1789964">
<para id="fs-id1370472"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1166761270071">
<para id="fs-id4333775"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2790511">
<problem id="fs-id2275695">
<para id="fs-id2994172"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2452675">
<problem id="fs-id1565941">
<para id="fs-id2261411"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1363941">
<para id="fs-id2257996"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1789503">
<problem id="fs-id1379598">
<para id="fs-id2371142"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id761801">
<problem id="fs-id1563224">
<para id="fs-id3302598"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1358209">
<para id="fs-id1919046"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1371604">
<problem id="fs-id2376208">
<para id="fs-id2619715"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2266447">
<problem id="fs-id1694179">
<para id="fs-id2494660"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2669263">
<para id="fs-id1378522"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>48</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1547777">
<problem id="fs-id1357061">
<para id="fs-id1341395"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2646654">
<problem id="fs-id2325525">
<para id="fs-id1880999"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2906250">
<para id="fs-id1358780"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1543448">
<problem id="fs-id1988732">
<para id="fs-id1817001"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2129495">
<problem id="fs-id2661765">
<para id="fs-id2661255"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1807698">
<para id="fs-id2711243"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2771254">
<problem id="fs-id1732927">
<para id="fs-id3273740"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1630988">
<problem id="fs-id2277299">
<para id="fs-id2951922"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1210856">
<para id="fs-id1732060"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>60</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2279472">
<problem id="fs-id2165624">
<para id="fs-id1601933"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1561338">
<problem id="fs-id2173746">
<para id="fs-id3401582"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>48</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1328350">
<para id="fs-id3340623"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>53</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2382277">
<problem id="fs-id2451244">
<para id="fs-id1239728"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>39</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>56</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>22</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1781874">
<problem id="fs-id1701793">
<para id="fs-id1595018"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>33</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>49</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2217938">
<para id="fs-id2295647"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>291</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>245</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id892228">
<problem id="fs-id2482369">
<para id="fs-id1570507"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1977577">
<problem id="fs-id1356663">
<para id="fs-id2205607"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1485180">
<para id="fs-id1586226"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1944491">
<problem id="fs-id1811610">
<para id="fs-id1511680"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1842640">
<problem id="fs-id1967647">
<para id="fs-id1369121"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2484072">
<para id="fs-id1278966"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2201189">
<problem id="fs-id769305">
<para id="fs-id1972086"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2676565">
<problem id="fs-id2730066">
<para id="fs-id2330719"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id4131869">
<para id="fs-id764524"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1129708">
<problem id="fs-id2257843">
<para id="fs-id1462568"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1516056">
<problem id="fs-id1299371">
<para id="fs-id1767322"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2478269">
<para id="fs-id2378224"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2176062">
<problem id="fs-id2954632">
<para id="fs-id1602619"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1511787">
<problem id="fs-id1597344">
<para id="fs-id2377079"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1881106">
<para id="fs-id1909550"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2676675">
<problem id="fs-id1808029">
<para id="fs-id1891088"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1811499">
<problem id="fs-id2278558">
<para id="fs-id2215867"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2135697">
<para id="fs-id835385"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1502515"><emphasis effect="bold">ভগ্নাংশের যোগ, বিয়োগ, গুণ ও ভাগ চেনা ও প্রয়োগ</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-802">নীচের অনুশীলনীগুলিতে নির্দেশিত গাণিতিক প্রক্রিয়াগুলি সম্পন্ন করো। উত্তর লঘিষ্ঠ আকারে লেখো।</para><exercise id="fs-id1795724">
<problem id="fs-id2599807">
<para id="fs-id2678249"><list id="eip-id1168466001273" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2273527">
<problem id="fs-id1367083">
<para id="fs-id2905950"><list id="eip-id1168469672095" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2790801">
<para id="fs-id1579914"><list id="eip-id1168468748585" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1221888">
<problem id="fs-id1340061">
<para id="fs-id2398143"><list id="eip-id1168466595711" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1407818">
<problem id="fs-id1950558">
<para id="fs-id2326593"><list id="eip-id1168466163113" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2784436">
<para id="fs-id1345691"><list id="eip-id1168466050341" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>37</m:mn><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2777894">
<problem id="fs-id1714014">
<para id="fs-id1313240"><list id="eip-id1168466037179" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1542072">
<problem id="fs-id2166810">
<para id="fs-id2471040"><list id="eip-id1168469832555" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2132234">
<para id="fs-id2299611"><list id="eip-id1168467335382" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1357328">
<problem id="fs-id2953683">
<para id="fs-id2630564"><list id="eip-id1168466124567" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>d</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mi>d</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2749365">
<problem id="fs-id1612017">
<para id="fs-id1241982"><list id="eip-id1168469873489" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1387204">
<para id="fs-id1984845"><list id="eip-id1168468520212" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>45</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>

<exercise id="fs-id1308127">
<problem id="fs-id1517888">
<para id="fs-id1563316"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>

<exercise id="fs-id2203099">
<problem id="fs-id2658576">
<para id="fs-id2204668"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="sol-00001">
  <para id="para-00002"><m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>

<exercise id="fs-id2863928">
<problem id="fs-id1371092">
<para id="fs-id1632984"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2357298">
<problem id="fs-id2208794">
<para id="fs-id1607348"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1781788">
<para id="fs-id1629180"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2946174">
<problem id="fs-id607139">
<para id="fs-id1350806"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1525903">
<problem id="fs-id1511182">
<para id="fs-id1927696"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1394340">
<para id="fs-id1724827"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1693547">
<problem id="fs-id3264246">
<para id="fs-id2280686"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1369432">
<problem id="fs-id2141070">
<para id="fs-id2877396"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2295777">
<para id="fs-id1943615"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2165572">
<problem id="fs-id1208719">
<para id="fs-id1363106"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id4120740">
<problem id="fs-id2130636">
<para id="fs-id1921058"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1913664">
<para id="fs-id2684999"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>−33</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>88</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1542547">
<problem id="fs-id3398787">
<para id="fs-id2199392"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>। সম্পাদকীয় শর্ত: মূল রাশির হরে a আছে, তাই a-এর মান শূন্য নয়।</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2832049">
<problem id="fs-id2298817">
<para id="fs-id3216948"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>। সম্পাদকীয় শর্ত: মূল রাশির হরে y আছে, তাই y-এর মান শূন্য নয়।</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2649935">
<para id="fs-id2835276"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>39</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>। সম্পাদকীয় শর্ত: মূল রাশির জন্য y-এর মান শূন্য নয়।</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1407162"><emphasis effect="bold">গাণিতিক প্রক্রিয়ার ক্রম মেনে জটিল ভগ্নাংশ সরল করা</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-313">নীচের অনুশীলনীগুলিতে সরল করো।</para><exercise id="fs-id1484431">
<problem id="fs-id1266695">
<para id="fs-id1322383"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id4222157">
<problem id="fs-id3448074">
<para id="fs-id2279309"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1576804">
<para id="fs-id2264697"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>81</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1325326">
<problem id="fs-id818515">
<para id="fs-id1262963"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id817327">
<problem id="fs-id4211933">
<para id="fs-id3407521"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1382289">
<para id="fs-id2619954">32</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1827264">
<problem id="fs-id1582367">
<para id="fs-id1246341"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1238942">
<problem id="fs-id1567649">
<para id="fs-id1569725"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1458024">
<para id="fs-id1970690"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>36</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1919907">
<problem id="fs-id1931788">
<para id="fs-id2607163"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1570614">
<problem id="fs-id1386912">
<para id="fs-id1733758"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1904848">
<para id="fs-id1572134"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>60</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1311655">
<problem id="fs-id2316211">
<para id="fs-id2199117"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1736945">
<problem id="fs-id1581539">
<para id="fs-id2817140"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1401807">
<para id="fs-id1920884"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2139031">
<problem id="fs-id1733947">
<para id="fs-id1366497"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1762426">
<problem id="fs-id2174033">
<para id="fs-id1605492"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1567354">
<para id="fs-id1836246"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id2579369"><emphasis effect="bold">সমন্বিত অনুশীলন</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-125">নীচের অনুশীলনীগুলিতে সরল করো।</para><exercise id="fs-id1892707">
<problem id="fs-id1301015">
<para id="fs-id1160479"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1823569">
<problem id="fs-id1356051">
<para id="fs-id2165581"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2279697">
<para id="fs-id2627999"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2270178">
<problem id="fs-id2820295">
<para id="fs-id2567808"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2306540">
<problem id="fs-id2820274">
<para id="fs-id2567844"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1263745">
<para id="fs-id1464453">−9</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id769205">
<problem id="fs-id2833139">
<para id="fs-id2751683"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2007280">
<problem id="fs-id2369220">
<para id="fs-id1827704"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1762282">
<para id="fs-id1189140"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>91</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>60</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1860918">
<problem id="fs-id2645447">
<para id="fs-id2205739"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2474528">
<problem id="fs-id2277293">
<para id="fs-id2425029"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1594536">
<para id="fs-id2218618"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1529415">
<problem id="fs-id1236123">
<para id="fs-id1580837"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2212470">
<problem id="fs-id1510273">
<para id="fs-id3195631"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1404607">
<para id="fs-id2567736"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1919873">
<problem id="fs-id2267662">
<para id="fs-id1565221"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1160473">
<problem id="fs-id2269486">
<para id="fs-id1549457"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2487973">
<para id="fs-id2137954">1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2198553">
<problem id="fs-id1529639">
<para id="fs-id1970858"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2926286">
<problem id="fs-id1543940">
<para id="fs-id2139913"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1826390">
<para id="fs-id2433503"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>22</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id2678855">নীচের অনুশীলনীগুলিতে চলের দেওয়া মান বসিয়ে রাশির মান নির্ণয় করো। উত্তর লঘিষ্ঠ আকারে লেখো; প্রয়োজনে অপ্রকৃত ভগ্নাংশ ব্যবহার করো।</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1742183">
<problem id="fs-id2453957">
<para id="fs-id2151244"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন<newline /><list id="eip-id1168468301550" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1829310">
<problem id="fs-id1391659">
<para id="fs-id1969382"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন<newline /><list id="eip-id1168466661076" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1816448">
<para id="fs-id1795862"><list id="eip-id1168468416603" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>−1</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2298245">
<problem id="fs-id3195456">
<para id="fs-id1522392"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন<newline /><list id="eip-id1168466145706" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1517657">
<problem id="fs-id2700271">
<para id="fs-id2201201"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন<newline /><list id="eip-id1168466026714" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2160894">
<para id="fs-id1967476"><list id="eip-id1168466154679" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn> 0</m:mn></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1371534">
<problem id="fs-id2296162">
<para id="fs-id2704028"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <list id="eip-id1168469522774" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1336683">
<problem id="fs-id1919317">
<para id="fs-id1824484"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <list id="eip-id1168466661039" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1582387">
<para id="fs-id2594218"><list id="eip-id1168468725882" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>

<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>−1</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1566707">
<problem id="fs-id1944626">
<para id="fs-id2197597"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>w</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <list id="eip-id1168469523171" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mi>w</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mi>w</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1542261">
<problem id="fs-id2472320">
<para id="fs-id1729362"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>w</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <list id="eip-id1168466154678" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mi>w</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mi>w</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1800603">
<para id="fs-id1947559"><list id="eip-id1168467310253" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1298696">
<problem id="fs-id2479126">
<para id="fs-id1390294"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>q</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>q</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>।</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2206208">
<problem id="fs-id1515895">
<para id="fs-id1300013"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>।</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2304204">
<para id="fs-id769247"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2880607">
<problem id="fs-id1410621">
<para id="fs-id2431902"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <m:math><m:mrow> <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow> <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>।</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2212088">
<problem id="fs-id2172630">
<para id="fs-id2144930"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:msup><m:mi>v</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <m:math><m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>v</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>।</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2486429">
<para id="fs-id2842873"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1977252">
<problem id="fs-id2306335">
<para id="fs-id2266512"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>v</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mi>w</m:mi></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>u</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>v</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>w</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>।</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2270617">
<problem id="fs-id2192202">
<para id="fs-id1631316"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mi>p</m:mi></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−6</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>।</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2486692">
<para id="fs-id2707139">−2</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id825594">
<problem id="fs-id2648730">
<para id="fs-id1582493"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>।</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1394420">
<problem id="fs-id1949529">
<para id="fs-id1756409"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mi>r</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>s</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mi>r</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>s</m:mi></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> রাশিটির মান নির্ণয় করো, যখন <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>r</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>s</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>।</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id3294263">
<para id="fs-id2603810">3</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</section><section id="fs-id1321595" class="everyday">
<title>রোজকার জীবনে গণিত</title>
<exercise id="fs-id361712">
<problem id="fs-id1752622">
<para id="fs-id1862457"><emphasis effect="bold">ঘর সাজানো</emphasis> — লারন্ডা তার সোফার ছোটো কুশনগুলির কভার তৈরি করছে। প্রতিটি কভারের জন্য তার দরকার <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> গজ ছাপা নকশাযুক্ত কাপড় এবং <m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> গজ একরঙা কাপড়। প্রতিটি কুশনের কভারের জন্য লারন্ডার মোট কত গজ কাপড় দরকার?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id3253872">
<problem id="fs-id1788976">
<para id="fs-id2367854"><emphasis effect="bold">কুকি তৈরি</emphasis> — ভ্যানেসা চকোলেট চিপ কুকি এবং ওটমিল কুকি তৈরি করছে। চকোলেট চিপ কুকির জন্য তার দরকার <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> কাপ চিনি এবং ওটমিল কুকির জন্য <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> কাপ চিনি। সব মিলিয়ে তার কত কাপ চিনি দরকার?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1242631">
<para id="fs-id1481955">তার দরকার <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mfrac><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math> কাপ চিনি।</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</section>
<section id="fs-id2265862" class="writing">
<title>লিখে প্রকাশ করো</title>
<exercise id="fs-id2661875">
<problem id="fs-id1247119">
<para id="fs-id1932985">ভগ্নাংশ যোগ বা বিয়োগ করতে হর একই হওয়া কেন দরকার, তা ব্যাখ্যা করো।</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1630265">
<problem id="fs-id2436226">
<para id="fs-id2459947">দুটি ভগ্নাংশের লঘিষ্ঠ সাধারণ হর কীভাবে নির্ণয় করতে হয়, তা ব্যাখ্যা করো।</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1529337">
<para id="fs-id1466885">উত্তর বিভিন্ন রকম হতে পারে।</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</section><section id="eip-284" class="self-check"><title>নিজের শেখা যাচাই করো</title><para id="eip-id1168469742398"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> অনুশীলনীগুলি শেষ করার পরে, এই পাঠের শেখার উদ্দেশ্যগুলি কতটা আয়ত্ত করেছ, তা যাচাই করতে এই তালিকাটি ব্যবহার করো।
</para>


<para id="eip-567"><figure id="eip-id1164270985699" class="unnumbered"><label /><media id="eip-id1164270985702" alt="নিজের শেখা যাচাই করার তালিকা। প্রতিটি কাজের জন্য তিনটি অবস্থার একটি বেছে নাও: ‘আত্মবিশ্বাসের সঙ্গে পারি’, ‘কিছুটা সাহায্য পেলে পারি’, অথবা ‘না, বুঝতে পারিনি’। কাজগুলি হলো: ভিন্ন হরযুক্ত ভগ্নাংশ যোগ ও বিয়োগ করা; ভগ্নাংশের যোগ, বিয়োগ, গুণ ও ভাগ চেনা ও প্রয়োগ করা; গাণিতিক প্রক্রিয়ার ক্রম মেনে জটিল ভগ্নাংশ সরল করা; এবং ভগ্নাংশযুক্ত বীজগাণিতিক রাশিতে চলের মান বসিয়ে রাশির মান নির্ণয় করা।"><image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_AppB_024.jpg" /></media></figure>
</para><para id="eip-id1168466075811"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> তালিকায় দেওয়া তোমার উত্তরগুলি বিবেচনা করে বলো, পরের পাঠের জন্য তুমি ভালোভাবে প্রস্তুত বলে মনে হচ্ছে কি? কেন মনে হচ্ছে বা হচ্ছে না, তা ব্যাখ্যা করো।
</para></section></section>
</content></document>